## 3. Data Types

| Type | Description | Object Structure |
|------|-------------|------------------|
| **integer** | 32-bit integer | `[CLASS, value]` |
| **boolean** | True/False (1/0) | `[CLASS, value]` |
| **objectPointer** | Reference to Dale object | `[CLASS, pointer]` |
| **object** | Base type (superclass of all) | `[CLASS, ...]` |
| **code** | Executable Dale statement | `[CLASS, code]` |
| **block** | Closure `($ ... $)` | `[CLASS, N, ivars, expr1, ..., exprN]` |
| **anIndexableObject** | Array-like indexed object | `[CLASS, array]` |
| **string** | Vector of characters | `[CLASS, c1, c2, ..., cN, NULL]` |
| **error** | Internal error object | `[CLASS, ...]` |
| **array** | Fixed-size array of objects | `[CLASS, elem1, elem2, ..., NULL]` |

### 3.1 Object Memory Layout

All objects have a **class pointer** at index `-1`.

#### Integer Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (integer)
 0     Integer Value
```

#### Boolean Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (boolean)
 0     1 (true) or 0 (false)
```

#### String Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (string)
 0     Character 1
 1     Character 2
 ...   ...
 N     NULL terminator
```

#### Array Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (array)
 0     Size
 1     Element 1
 2     Element 2
 ...   ...
 N     NULL
```

#### ObjectPointer Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (objectPointer)
 0     Pointer to target object (0 = null)
```

#### Class Descriptor Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (CLASS)
  0    Super Class Pointer
  1    Instance Variables Pointer
  2    Class Methods Pointer
  3    External Methods Pointer
  4    Internal Methods Pointer
  5    Pointer to Class Print Name
```

#### Method Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (METHODS)
  0    Number of Methods
  1    Template Pointer (for this method)
  2    Block Pointer (for this method)
 ...   ...
 N-1    Pointer to last Template
 N      Pointer to last Block
```

#### Template Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (TEMPLATE)
  0    Primary Message String Pointer
  1    <NULL> | Parameter Print Name Pointer
  2    Parameter Offset
  3    Parameter Type Print Name Pointer
  4    <NULL> | Message Delimiter Print Name Pointer
  5    <NULL> | Second Parameter Print Name Pointer
  6    Second Parameter Offset
  7    Second Parameter Type Print Name Pointer
 ...   ...
 N      NULL (N=4n where n = number of parameters)
```

#### Block Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (BLOCK)
  0    Number of Statements (N)
  1    Block Instance Variables Pointer
  2    Expression Pointer 1
  3    Expression Pointer 2
 ...   ...
 N+2    Expression Pointer N
```

#### Expression Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (EXPRESSION)
  0    Dale Syntactic Object Pointer 1
  1    Dale Syntactic Object Pointer 2
  2    Dale Syntactic Object Pointer 3
 ...   ...
 N      NULL
```

#### Variable Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (VARIABLE)
  0    Variable Print Name Pointer
  1    Offset
```

#### Parameter Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (PARAMETER)
  0    Parameter Print Name Pointer
  1    Offset
```

#### Instance Variables Object
```
Index  Content
-----  --------
-1     CLASS OBJECT POINTER (FIELD)
  0    Search Pointer
  1    Number of Variables
  2    Pointer to Variable Print Name
  3    Pointer to Variable Type Print Name
  4    Offset
 ...   ...
 N-2    Pointer to last Variable Print Name
 N-1    Pointer to last Var Type Print Name
 N      Offset
```

