## 14. Complete Examples

### 14.1 Class Definition

```dale
CLASS RegularPolygon
    SUPERCLASS : Object
    INSTANCE VARIABLES :
        sides; center; radius; plotter.

    CLASS METHODS :
        sides:$ s radius:$ r
            ($
                RETURN SELF new sides: s radius: r center:
                             (Screen ActiveWindow frame center)
            $)

    INSTANCE METHODS :
        EXTERNAL
        sides:$ s radius:$ r center:$ c
            ($
                sides <- s;
                center <- c;
                radius <- r;
                plotter <- pen width 2;
            $)

        center?
            ($
                RETURN center;
            $)

    ENDCLASS.
```

