### 14.8 Complex Example

```dale
CLASS Stack
    SUPERCLASS : Object
    INSTANCE VARIABLES :
        items; top.

    CLASS METHODS :
        new
            ($
                RETURN SELF new items: (array new: 100) top: 0;
            $)

    INSTANCE METHODS :
        EXTERNAL
        new
            ($
                RETURN SELF items: (array new: 100) top: 0;
            $)

        push:$ item
            ($
                top <- top + 1;
                items put: item at: top;
                RETURN self;
            $)

        pop
            ($
                var result.
                result <- items at: top;
                items put: nil at: top;
                top <- top - 1;
                RETURN result;
            $)

        isEmpty
            ($
                RETURN top = 0;
            $)

        size
            ($
                RETURN top;
            $)

    ENDCLASS.

"Usage"
stack <- Stack new;
stack push: 42;
stack push: 43;
val <- stack pop;
```

