## 17. Limitations and Notes

### 17.1 Current Limitations

- **Type checking**: Not enforced (declarations ignored)
- **super**: Not implemented
- **Internal environment**: Not supported
- **Control environment**: Not implemented
- **Compilation**: Not available (interpreted only)

### 17.2 Future Features

- Type checking and enforcement
- `super` keyword implementation
- Compiled code generation
- Multiple inheritance
- Better error messages
- Improved string handling

### 17.3 Known Issues

- `self` in `TimesRepeat:` refers to integer, not outer self
- String creation requires spaces around `!"`
- Type declarations have no effect
- No garbage collection mentioned

