## 19. Glossary

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| **Dale** | Object-oriented language based on Smalltalk |
| **Object** | Entity with methods and instance variables |
| **Message** | Request sent to an object |
| **Primary Message** | First keyword in a message |
| **Delimiter** | Keyword separating parameters |
| **Block** | Closure `($ ... $)` |
| **Diphthong** | Special multi-character token |
| **Primitive** | Lisp-implemented method |
| **Template** | Method signature definition |
| **Class** | Object template/blueprint |
| **Function** | Single-method object with assumed message |
| **Macro** | Method with unevaluated parameters |
| **Self** | Object receiving the message |
| **Instance Variable** | Object storage |
| **Inheritance** | Reusing superclass methods/variables |

